# Sentinel of Lost Lore: "Exile target player's graveyard" (CR 700.2, 406.2): any player, its own controller included. Bot1's graveyard holds Swords to Plowshares and the sacrificed Black Lotus and Bot2's the Lightning Bolt; Bot1 chooses itself, so only its own graveyard is exiled and Bot2's Bolt stays. The Giants and the Memnite stay in exile (the modes about them were not chosen).

